      "data": {
        "label": "C4 level 2: Containers\nThe Ticketing & Booking Platform split into its deployable units: backend services, frontend applications and the database, with the people and external systems around it. Each service and application links down to its components (level 3).\nShow the legend for what the colours and arrows mean."
